  "competencies": [
    {
      "id": "requirements",
      "title": {
        "lines": [
          "Business",
          "goals"
        ],
        "break": "always"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        "Everyone can agree on what to build and still picture a different version of success. I make those expectations explicit, so we can agree on the outcome and how we’ll know we’ve achieved it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "process",
      "title": {
        "lines": [
          "User",
          "needs"
        ],
        "break": "always"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        "Identical job titles don’t mean identical needs. I discover how your team actually works, including exceptions and judgment calls, before turning those needs into requirements."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "evaluation",
      "title": {
        "lines": [
          "Existing",
          "processes"
        ],
        "break": "always"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        "If your process only works when the right person is around, some of its rules may still live in their head. I uncover those unwritten decisions and make them explicit, so the team has a process it can actually follow."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "stakeholders",
      "title": {
        "lines": [
          "Solution",
          "constraints"
        ],
        "break": "always"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        "A promising solution can look very different once integration, compliance and ongoing maintenance enter the picture. I weigh those constraints alongside the benefits, including whether a simpler alternative could achieve the same goal."
      ]
    }
  ],
